{"en": "&lt;p&gt;LINKEN Studio&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Imac&lt;br&gt;Behringer X-32, Digital Mixer/Sound Card&lt;br&gt;16 microphone inputs&lt;br&gt;Microphones for vocals and instruments&lt;br&gt;Genelec Monitors&lt;br&gt;ProTools (no lisence)&lt;br&gt;Cubase 5 + 10 Pro&lt;br&gt;Ableton live&lt;br&gt;Reason 5&lt;br&gt;FL Studio&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The sound studio is connected to Bandrom 1 and 2 via multi-cables, and there is a window between the studio and øvingsrom 1.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Note: If you want to use band rooms for recording, these must be booked at the same time, as it is not included automatically.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Price:&lt;br&gt;- Youth up to and including 25 years: free&lt;br&gt;-Voluntary/non-profit organizations: kr. 50/hour.&lt;br&gt;-Adults kr. 100/hour.&lt;br&gt;-Commercial coustomer kr. 150/hour.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The activity card from Bergen Municipality can be used to cover the rent.&lt;br&gt;Up to 3 days processing time is expected on applications.", "nn": "", "no": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;LINKEN Studio&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Imac&lt;br&gt;Behringer X-32, digitalmikser/lydkort&lt;br&gt;16 mikrofoninnganger&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Mikrofoner til vokal og instrumenter&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Genelec monitorer&lt;br&gt;ProTools(ikke lisens)&lt;br&gt;Cubase 5 + 10 Pro &lt;br&gt;Ableton live&lt;br&gt;Reason 5&lt;br&gt;FL Studio&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

